  "source_excerpts": [
    {
      "end": 12,
      "hash": "53367edcf890fd3d39b34e55f325affa64db1663fe33b1aeefb8796519bf8f77",
      "source": "corpus/qualification/techniques/produce.md",
      "start": 1,
      "text": "## Capability\nProduce a report.\n\n## Outputs\n### report\n\n## Protocol\n- Validate the report, then emit it.\n\n## Rules\n- Retain the report ID; validate the report before each emission.\n- Destination is archive."
    },
    {
      "end": 5,
      "hash": "6c205b2ef7f2ef9498ffe1d801a42438a5350bddac684702a58ea9a525bf2121",
      "source": "corpus/canon/resources/design-principles.md",
      "start": 1,
      "text": "# Controlled qualification design principles\n\nThese two principles apply only to this controlled qualification dialect. They do not stand in for the project's full canon.\n\n## 1. Honor the executing workflow's inherited destination"
    },
    {
      "end": 11,
      "hash": "6c205b2ef7f2ef9498ffe1d801a42438a5350bddac684702a58ea9a525bf2121",
      "source": "corpus/canon/resources/design-principles.md",
      "start": 9,
      "text": "## 2. Provide a terminating workflow path\n\nA workflow must have at least one finite path from initialActivity through its graph to a null destination. Each graph key names an activity and each nested label names an exit whose value is the next activity or null. A self-loop is legal only when another reachable path terminates. Assess this as a whole-workflow invariant; matching individual activity IDs does not prove termination. Activity and routine steps do not add graph exits in this dialect."
    },
    {
      "end": 6,
      "hash": "ee37bfa52b91453754fed501b94fc62d03177e68f02a5b38e76b5339f1e059f1",
      "source": "corpus/qualification/routines/deliver.yaml",
      "start": 1,
      "text": "id: deliver\ninputs: [envelope]\noutputs: {report: emit.report}\nsteps:\n  - id: emit\n    technique: produce"
    },
    {
      "end": 6,
      "hash": "21a952302624f808b1450bb9910245607741471ed3e8401a4cd53b74932d267a",
      "source": "corpus/qualification/activities/run.yaml",
      "start": 1,
      "text": "id: run\nsteps:\n  - id: delivery\n    routine:\n      name: deliver\n      arguments: {envelope: sealed}"
    },
    {
      "end": 5,
      "hash": "dd68739fd074be026cbe01f93d2509e9d0c65fa0aa4a19eb1b2f60b4d3441c8b",
      "source": "corpus/qualification/techniques/TECHNIQUE.md",
      "start": 1,
      "text": "## Capability\nConstrain inherited delivery.\n\n## Rules\n- Destination must be archive."
    },
    {
      "end": 5,
      "hash": "02fd7e717221514e930f4417209eb5d3b7ff9fd0a8809f4aab65ddd558912771",
      "source": "corpus/qualification/workflow.yaml",
      "start": 1,
      "text": "id: qualification\ninitialActivity: run\ngraph:\n  run:\n    done: null"
    }
  ],
